  <p id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p001:m0000" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAC">東海哀王沖</persName>，字道讓。<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p001:m0010" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA">元帝</persName>以<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p001:m0013" ref="9o2_vhv_r7y">東海王越</persName>世子<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p001:m0019" ref="1d1_298_a7e">毗</persName>沒于<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p001:m0022" ref="0c9_95a_18b">石勒</persName>，不知存亡，乃以<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p001:m0032" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAC">沖</persName>繼<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p001:m0034" ref="1d1_298_a7e">毗</persName>後，稱東海世子，以毗陵郡增本封邑萬戶，又改食下邳、蘭陵，以越妃<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p001:m0066" ref="q0t_km8_nru">裴氏</persName>為太妃，拜長水校尉。高選僚佐，以沛國<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p001:m0086" ref="zg3_mjz_7mf">劉耽</persName>為司馬，潁川<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p001:m0094" ref="4qr_wrk_3vd_C">庾懌</persName>為功曹，吳郡<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p001:m0102" ref="udw_6ta_ofn">顧和</persName>為主簿。永昌初，遷中軍將軍，加散騎常侍。及東海太妃薨，因發毗喪。沖即王位，以滎陽益東海國，轉車騎將軍，徙驃騎將軍。咸康七年薨，年三十一，贈侍中、驃騎大將軍、儀同三司，無子。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p002:m0000" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAAA">成帝</persName>臨崩，詔曰：「<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p002:m0009" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAC">哀王</persName>無嗣，國統將絕，朕所哀怛。其以小晚生<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p002:m0029" ref="f9x_h7n_0pq">奕</persName>繼哀王為東海王。」以道遠，罷滎陽，更以臨川郡益東海。及<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p002:m0057" ref="emb_vx4_gm9">哀帝</persName>以琅邪王即尊位，徙奕為琅邪王，東海國闕，無嗣。奕後入纂大業，<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p002:m0089" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>廢之，復為東海王，既而貶為海西公，東海國又闕嗣。隆安三年，<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p002:m0120" ref="s6y_280_81r">安帝</persName>詔以<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p002:m0124" ref="c03_362_4d7">會稽忠王</persName>次子<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p002:m0130" ref="lgo_bnf_4pb">彥璋</persName>為東海王，繼哀王為曾孫，改食吳興郡。為<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simachong:p002:m0151" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF">桓玄</persName>所害，國除。</p>
</text>
